{block content}

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="p-5 text-white bg-dark">
            <h3>Researcher</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="space-2em"></div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
        <img class="img-rounded" src="{$baseUrl}/img/scientist_2.jpg" alt="Vědec" width="100%">
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
        <p>Are you involved in a similar or related research? We are always ready to co-operate on interesting ideas. Just let us know.</p>
    </div>
</div>
    
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="space-2em"></div>
    </div>
</div>
    
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="p-5 text-white bg-dark">
            <h3>Manufacturer</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="space-2em"></div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
        <img class="img-rounded" src="{$baseUrl}/img/company.jpg" alt="Výrobce" width="100%">
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
        <p>Does your device help to regulate blood glucose level? We offer advanced models of glucose dynamics and respective processing of measured signals, for both in-silico and in-vitro/vivo. If you are interested, contact us to discuss a future cooperation.</p>
        <p>Our team works in the laboratories of the NTIS - New Technology for Information Society, a European centre of excellence and a part of Faculty of Applied Sciences, University of West Bohemia, and the 1st Department of Clinic Medicine, Teaching Hospital and Medical School in Pilsen, Charles University in Prague.</p>
    </div>
</div>
    
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="space-2em"></div>
    </div>
</div>
    
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="p-5 text-white bg-dark">
            <h3>Student</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="space-2em"></div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
        <img class="img-rounded" src="{$baseUrl}/img/student_2.jpg" alt="Student" width="100%">
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
        <p>We support young talents. There is a work for bachelor, master and doctoral students - especially for students of technical and medical faculties. Working on a part of the project will give you a unique experience. Primarily, we focus on medicine, modelling and simulation, programmers, mobile applications, databases, etc.</p>
        <p>If you want would like to join our team, contact us. If you have never worked on any project - there is no shame in not knowing; the shame lies in not finding out. We will explain everything so that practice will make perfect.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="space-2em"></div>
    </div>
</div>
